><name><surname>Miranda</surname><given-names>C</given-names></name><name><surname>Lylyk</surname><given-names>P</given-names></name><name><surname>Heller</surname><given-names>PG</given-names></name><name><surname>Molinas</surname><given-names>FC</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Moyamoya syndrome in an adolescent with essential thrombocythemia: successful intracranial carotid stent placement</article-title><source>Stroke</source><year>2005</year><volume>36</volume><fpage>71</fpage><lpage>3</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1161/01.STR.0000174193.89864.55</pub-id></citation></ref></ref-list></back></article>